  "description": "The most legendary wheel in BMX is back! This next gen, king-of-wheels is BMX to its core. Whether you're putting the finishing touches on your dream build or showing them off in your mancave – the Motomag III is the perfect addition to any serious BMX collection.\nThe next generation Motomag III wheelset is a centerpiece for any BMX enthusiast to complete a retro bike build or bring classic Mongoose style to a modern ride. Pair ships in retro packaging.\nDie cast aluminum alloy design with exacting details based on its predecessor the Motomag II. Model number pays homage to the original patent number #236609.\nModern upgrades include sealed bearing hubs and freewheel-compatible rear wheel for a more universal fit.\nDurable powder coat finish in three classic colorways – silver, gold and black – with CNC machined rim brake surface.\nLimit 2 sets per color per customer. Promo codes are not valid.",
